# Copy to `.env.local` to change how the dev server reaches the API.
#
# The default needs nothing: the Vite dev proxy in vite.config.ts forwards
# `/api` to the API on 8090, which keeps the UI and the API same-origin.

# Where the dev proxy forwards /api. Matches API_DEFAULTS in tools/planner/api.
VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8090
